{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.poster.avif?t=1769000562\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.webm?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.mp4?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dave. What ties him to RDS?<br>Maybe this facility is more than just a place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He woke up, believing the nightmare was over?<br>What if awakening was only the beginning\u2026 the beginning of the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He went there to make sure it was just a figment of his imagination?<br>Maybe this place was truly born\u2026 from the greed and malice of those who knew no limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He only wanted to take a look?<br>But what if RDS is a cancer that can never be removed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.poster.avif?t=1769000562\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.webm?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.mp4?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s looking for a way out?<br>Do you feel that every step only drags him deeper\u2026 just so RDS can consume him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey! Wait for me. Before it\u2019s too late...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.poster.avif?t=1769000562\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.webm?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.mp4?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of puzzles and exploration within a dark, underground facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenges using interactive objects and your environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience close encounters with enemies, where quick thinking and clever reactions are key.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some less important areas are intentionally dark by default. You can increase brightness in the settings, if you want those areas to be bright anyway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dislike Player's camera swinging left and right, you can adjust it in settings under &quot;Gameplay&quot; tab, or you can uncheck &quot;Dynamic camera&quot; to minimize animations of the camera.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Valve's Portal&quot;\u00a0<strong>isn't</strong> the primary inspiration for this game. Meaning, it won't follow the same rules, or design decisions.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960010?t=1769000562","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/8f32b60935d2109dff053dd7ed117f395420d87a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769000562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/5a6fa4ce74808a47859d91bd7f981fdbe5a6580c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769000562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/5a6fa4ce74808a47859d91bd7f981fdbe5a6580c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769000562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3978220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.poster.avif?t=1769000562\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.webm?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.mp4?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dave. What ties him to RDS?<br>Maybe this facility is more than just a place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He woke up, believing the nightmare was over?<br>What if awakening was only the beginning\u2026 the beginning of the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He went there to make sure it was just a figment of his imagination?<br>Maybe this place was truly born\u2026 from the greed and malice of those who knew no limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He only wanted to take a look?<br>But what if RDS is a cancer that can never be removed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.poster.avif?t=1769000562\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.webm?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.mp4?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s looking for a way out?<br>Do you feel that every step only drags him deeper\u2026 just so RDS can consume him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey! Wait for me. Before it\u2019s too late...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.poster.avif?t=1769000562\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.webm?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.mp4?t=1769000562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of puzzles and exploration within a dark, underground facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenges using interactive objects and your environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience close encounters with enemies, where quick thinking and clever reactions are key.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some less important areas are intentionally dark by default. You can increase brightness in the settings, if you want those areas to be bright anyway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dislike Player's camera swinging left and right, you can adjust it in settings under &quot;Gameplay&quot; tab, or you can uncheck &quot;Dynamic camera&quot; to minimize animations of the camera.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Valve's Portal&quot;\u00a0<strong>isn't</strong> the primary inspiration for this game. Meaning, it won't follow the same rules, or design decisions.</p></li></ul>","developers":["PrismBytes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/28c7934c772562e09ba2e0bbc3293c9a72752670/header.jpg?t=1769000562","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i5 3570<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan support required | Low-Medium settings, 720p, 30-60 FPS</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 10400f<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><s